{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412090","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1141209001:1":{"text":"よぉ、いい匂いだな！何作ってんだ？","source_cn":"嘿，你们在炖什么！好香啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8BAE904A398E2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1141209002:1":{"text":"手を放せ。","source_cn":"把手拿开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD3C4776F4FFC874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141209003:1":{"text":"なんだよ、まだ出来上がりじゃないのか？","source_cn":"怎么，还没做好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B46FE821C7D8091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141209004:1":{"text":"働かざる者、食うべからず。","source_cn":"不出力的人，没资格吃饭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD66B1D106007672F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141209005:1":{"text":"俺様が「働かざる者」だと！？見てろよ！","source_cn":"竟敢说我不出力？！瞧着！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E501B90F4DAF8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141209006:1":{"text":"いいか、これが本物の……バードマウントの卵だ！","source_cn":"看好了，这可是真正的——陆行鸟蛋！